{"unit_id":"xiazhiyehuo__dsh-dsgirl#feature-audio-transcription","repo":"xiazhiyehuo/dsh-dsgirl","commit":"471d0c38068d63036e69f78363b77d34ff3cb8e0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dsgirl 的功能「音频转写」：hear 工具从最近的系统音频缓冲、实时录音或指定音频文件取得片段，调用 Whisper 转成文字，并返回语言、时长和声音特征。可选择时长、语言提示和 base/small 模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:103-146","python/hear.py:65-100"]}
{"unit_id":"xiazhiyehuo__dsh-dsgirl#feature-mic-check","repo":"xiazhiyehuo/dsh-dsgirl","commit":"471d0c38068d63036e69f78363b77d34ff3cb8e0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dsgirl 的功能「麦克风自检」：mic_status 查看系统默认麦克风、静音状态、音量和 Edge 记忆的输入设备；传入 test 时会额外录制两秒并报告信号强度。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:148-173","python/mic_check.py:8-42"]}
{"unit_id":"xiazhiyehuo__dsh-dsgirl#feature-screen-view","repo":"xiazhiyehuo/dsh-dsgirl","commit":"471d0c38068d63036e69f78363b77d34ff3cb8e0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dsgirl 的功能「屏幕查看」：see 可截取整个桌面或指定窗口，也可读取本地图片；可选叠加坐标网格，之后将图像作为附件返回给模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:189-256","python/grid.py:16-42"]}
{"unit_id":"xiazhiyehuo__dsh-dsgirl#feature-game-inspection","repo":"xiazhiyehuo/dsh-dsgirl","commit":"471d0c38068d63036e69f78363b77d34ff3cb8e0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dsgirl 的功能「游戏状态查看」：game_state 通过本机游戏桥接接口读取当前场景、地图、角色坐标与朝向、队伍状态、金币和对话内容。游戏需先安装并启动配套 GameBridge。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:258-305","gamebridge/GameBridge.js:24-46"]}
{"unit_id":"xiazhiyehuo__dsh-dsgirl#feature-game-controls","repo":"xiazhiyehuo/dsh-dsgirl","commit":"471d0c38068d63036e69f78363b77d34ff3cb8e0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dsgirl 的功能「游戏按键与移动」：game_press 可发送确认、取消、菜单和方向键；game_move 可让角色沿指定方向移动最多十步，并返回实际移动格数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:307-352","gamebridge/GameBridge.js:48-78"]}
